 "Perkiraan dengan aturan pertempuran game: tembok, menara & jebakan kota, riset militermu. Riset/artefak penyerang tidak diketahui (dianggap 0).": "Estimate with the game's battle rules: the city's wall, towers & traps and your military research. The attacker's research/artifacts are unknown (taken as 0).",
 "Simulasi: pilih kota & waktu untuk melihat siapa yang sempat membantu.": "Simulation: pick a city & time to see who can still help.",
 "Pasukan penyerang tidak terlihat dan belum ada riwayat dari pemain ini — kirim Scout untuk melihatnya.": "Attacking troops not visible and no history from this player — send Scouts to see them.",
 "Kekuatan bertahan di kota": "Defence in the city",
 "Kota yang bisa membantu": "Cities that can help",
 "Kirim sebelum": "Send before",
 "Sisa waktu": "Time left",
 "Naik {f} Frigate (500 TS per Frigate)": "Riding {f} Frigates (500 TS per Frigate)",
 "dari {n}": "of {n}",
 "tidak sempat (telat {t})": "too late (by {t})",
 "Pasukan support tidak makan selama di luar kota. Kirim dengan misi Support di game; unit cepat (Crossbowman, Paladin) paling sering sempat.": "Support troops eat no food while away. Send them with the Support mission in the game; fast units (Crossbowman, Paladin) make it in time most often.",
 "Tidak ada kota lain dengan pasukan di rumah.": "No other city with troops at home.",
 "🎯 Tab baru Operasi → Perencana serangan: pilih target & kota, jam kirim dihitung supaya semua tiba bersamaan atau bergelombang (jeda detik), dengan cek beda benua/Frigate, Castle, unit paling lambat, hitung mundur, dan teks rencana untuk disalin.": "🎯 New Operations tab → Attack planner: pick a target & cities; send times are worked out so everything lands together or in waves (gap in seconds), with checks for other continents/Frigates, Castle, slowest unit, countdowns, and a plan text to copy.",
 "🛡️ Operasi → Asisten bertahan: untuk tiap serangan masuk, kota mana yang masih sempat mengirim bantuan (unit, jam kirim terakhir, termasuk naik Frigate), perkiraan pertempuran dengan tembok/menara/jebakan & riset militermu, dan perkiraan pasukan penyerang dari riwayatnya; tombol 🛡️ Bantuan di Pergerakan, plus mode simulasi.": "🛡️ Operations → Defense assistant: for each incoming attack, which cities can still send support (units, latest send time, including riding Frigates), a battle estimate with wall/towers/traps & your military research, and the attacker's likely army from their history; a 🛡️ Support button in Movements, plus a simulation mode.",
 "🔬 Riset akun dibaca dari game: Hasil rencana memakai riset produksi (kayu/batu/besi/makanan/emas) dan Construction; Town Hall kini dihitung (+300 kayu/jam & kapasitasnya) dan level Town Hall asli ikut tersinkron (langkah pembangunan lebih tepat).": "🔬 Account research read from the game: Plan result uses production research (wood/stone/iron/food/gold) and Construction; the Town Hall now counts (+300 wood/h & its storage) and the real Town Hall level is synced (more accurate build steps).",
 "🌾 Neraca makanan pasukan: Ringkasan Kota → Makanan pasukan (produksi vs makan pasukan di kota, sisa waktu sampai habis, saat semua pasukan pulang & saat TS penuh) dan baris makanan saat TS penuh di Hasil rencana.": "🌾 Army food balance: City Overview → Army food (production vs upkeep of troops in the city, time until empty, when all troops are home & with full TS) and a food-with-full-TS line in Plan result.",
 "Operasi": "Operations",
 "Cottage dulu: mempercepat semua langkah berikutnya": "Cottage first: speeds up every later step",
 "Town Hall dinaikkan karena dibutuhkan bangunan berikutnya (syarat level / slot bangunan)": "Town Hall raised because the next building needs it (level requirement / building slots)",
 "Dibongkar sekarang untuk membebaskan slot bangunan": "Demolished now to free a building slot",
 "Level Town Hall sesuai rencana": "Town Hall level from the plan",
 "Kecepatan bangun saat langkah ini": "Construction speed at this step",
 "Dari {a} ke rencana {b}. Urutan pintar: Cottage dulu selama waktu yang dihemat lebih besar dari waktu bangunnya, Town Hall dinaikkan hanya saat dibutuhkan, lalu langkah dengan tambahan terbesar per jam bangun. Bangunan lama dibongkar tepat sebelum petaknya dipakai, jadi tetap berproduksi sampai saat itu. Waktu tiap langkah memakai kecepatan bangun saat itu (Cottage yang sudah jadi + riset Construction {r}%).": "From {a} to plan {b}. Smart order: Cottages first while the time they save is larger than their own build time, the Town Hall only when needed, then the step with the largest gain per hour of building. Old buildings are demolished right before their tile is used, so they keep producing until then. Each step uses the construction speed reached at that moment (finished Cottages + Construction research {r}%).",
 "hemat {t} dibanding urutan biasa": "saves {t} vs. the usual order",
