 "tidak ada": "none",
 "Kelompok unit kedua (opsional)": "Second unit group (optional)",
 "Porsi kelompok kedua (%)": "Second group share (%)",
 "Bagian recruit % total untuk kelompok kedua.": "Part of the total recruit % for the second group.",
 "Slot ekonomi (hybrid)": "Economy slots (hybrid)",
 "Cottage (kecepatan bangun) & Warehouse (stok untuk rekrut).": "Cottage (construction speed) & Warehouse (stock for recruiting).",
 "Cottage untuk kecepatan bangun.": "Cottage for construction speed.",
 "Petak bergaris = berubah dari {b} ({n} petak).": "Outlined tiles = changed from {b} ({n} tiles).",
 "porsi {p}%": "share {p}%",
 "Menghitung biaya & waktu…": "Calculating cost & time…",
 "Kota militer: recruit speed % sebesar mungkin untuk satu kelompok unit (atau dua, dengan porsi yang kamu tentukan), dengan troop space (TS) minimal sesuai target. Bangunan rekrut L10 = +150%, dan tiap Barracks L10 yang menempel menambah +25% — Barracks yang dikelilingi 8 bangunan rekrut bernilai +200%, jadi Barracks juga dipakai melebihi target TS bila itu menaikkan recruit %. TS = (100 + Barracks × 1.000) × (1 + Castle 300%).": "Military city: the highest recruit speed % for one unit group (or two, with a share you choose), with at least the target troop space (TS). A L10 recruitment building = +150%, and every bordering L10 Barracks adds +25% — a Barracks surrounded by 8 recruitment buildings is worth +200%, so Barracks are also used beyond the TS target when that raises recruit %. TS = (100 + Barracks × 1,000) × (1 + Castle 300%).",
 "📋 Langkah pembangunan lebih pintar: Cottage dulu bila waktu yang dihemat lebih besar, Town Hall dinaikkan hanya saat dibutuhkan (syarat level & slot), lalu langkah dengan tambahan terbesar per jam; bangunan lama dibongkar tepat sebelum petaknya dipakai; waktu dihitung dengan kecepatan bangun yang naik selama proses, plus kolom Tambahan dan perbandingan dengan urutan biasa.": "📋 Smarter build steps: Cottages first when the time saved is larger, the Town Hall only when needed (level & slot requirements), then the step with the largest gain per hour; old buildings are demolished right before their tile is used; times use the construction speed that rises along the way, plus a Gain column and a comparison with the usual order.",
 "⚖️ Kartu Perbandingan menampilkan total biaya & waktu bangun dari kota ke rencana; tabel Bandingkan berdampingan menampilkan waktu rekrut tiap unit.": "⚖️ The Comparison card shows the total cost & build time from the city to the plan; the side-by-side table shows the recruit time of each unit.",
 "🧩 Template: kelompok unit kedua dengan porsi %, slot ekonomi hybrid (Cottage & Warehouse; hub: Cottage), peta mini menandai petak yang berubah, dan perhitungan berjalan di latar belakang dengan progress bar & tombol Batal.": "🧩 Templates: a second unit group with a % share, hybrid economy slots (Cottage & Warehouse; hub: Cottage), the mini map marks changed tiles, and the calculation runs in the background with a progress bar & Cancel button.",
 "🧪 Tes otomatis untuk rumus game, template & urutan bangun (node --test tests/*.test.mjs), dan pengecekan terjemahan (node tests/i18n-check.mjs).": "🧪 Automatic tests for game formulas, templates & build order (node --test tests/*.test.mjs), and a translation check (node tests/i18n-check.mjs).",
