 "Waktu mengisi seluruh TS dengan unit ini": "Time to fill all TS with this unit",
 "⚔️ Perencana Layout → Hasil rencana: bila ada bangunan militer, tampil Troop space (TS), kecepatan rekrut % per kelompok bangunan rekrut (termasuk Barracks yang menempel), dan waktu rekrut tiap unit (mis. Training Ground → Berserker, Ranger, Guardian) beserta waktu mengisi TS; unit yang belum terbuka diberi tanda level bangunan yang dibutuhkan.": "⚔️ Layout Planner → Plan result: when the plan has military buildings, it shows Troop space (TS), recruit speed % per recruitment building group (including bordering Barracks), and the recruit time of each unit (e.g. Training Ground → Berserker, Ranger, Guardian) with the time to fill TS; locked units show the building level they need.",
