 "+{n} Barracks di atas target — menaikkan recruit %": "+{n} Barracks above the target — they raise recruit %",
 "🧩 Template militer & hub lebih maksimal: susunan dihitung ulang dengan pencarian yang jauh lebih teliti (recruit % dan kapasitas gudang naik), slot bangunan default 100 (Town Hall L10) — tidak lagi terbatas slot kota saat ini, Barracks ditambah di atas target TS bila menaikkan recruit %, opsi hapus node alam, dan Harbor untuk hub di kota air.": "🧩 Better military & hub templates: layouts are searched much more thoroughly (higher recruit % and storage), building slots default to 100 (Town Hall L10) instead of the city's current slots, extra Barracks beyond the TS target when they raise recruit %, an option to remove natural nodes, and Harbors for hubs in water cities.",
 "\"—\" = butuh lebih dari {c}% (≈ 100 bangunan rekrut level 10 × 150%), praktis tidak bisa dicapai.": "\"—\" = needs more than {c}% (≈ 100 level-10 recruitment buildings × 150%), practically unreachable.",
