 "<b>Belum ada data pergerakan.</b><br>Buka <a href=\"https://lordofultima.me/\" target=\"_blank\">lordofultima.me</a> — data pasukan, perdagangan &amp; pelatihan terbaca otomatis dalam beberapa detik.": "<b>No movement data yet.</b><br>Open <a href=\"https://lordofultima.me/\" target=\"_blank\">lordofultima.me</a> — troop, trade &amp; training data is read automatically within a few seconds.",
 "<b>Belum ada dungeon.</b><br>Di game buka tab <b>Region</b>; dungeon &amp; boss di peta tersimpan otomatis. Klik ikonnya untuk guardians &amp; max loot.": "<b>No dungeons yet.</b><br>In the game, open the <b>Region</b> tab; dungeons &amp; bosses on the map are saved automatically. Click their icon for guardians &amp; max loot.",
 "<b>Belum ada kota.</b><br>Buka <a href=\"https://lordofultima.me/\" target=\"_blank\">lordofultima.me</a>, login, lalu pindah-pindah kota sebentar. Data akan muncul di sini otomatis.": "<b>No cities yet.</b><br>Open <a href=\"https://lordofultima.me/\" target=\"_blank\">lordofultima.me</a>, log in, then switch between your cities for a moment. Data will appear here automatically.",
 "<b>Kill pasti</b> bila total serangan ≥ 4 × HP boss. Unit yang cocok dengan kelemahan boss mendapat serangan ×1.5. Di bawah itu peluang menang = √(serangan ÷ 4HP), atau 2 × rasio bila < 25%.": "<b>Guaranteed kill</b> when total attack ≥ 4 × boss HP. Units matching the boss weakness get ×1.5 attack. Below that, win chance = √(attack ÷ 4HP), or 2 × ratio when < 25%.",
 "<b>Rekomendasi</b> = jumlah minimum satu jenis unit agar <b>seluruh max loot terangkut</b> dan <b>kekuatan serangan ≥ kekuatan dungeon</b> (kerugian ≤ 10%). Arahkan kursor ke angka untuk detail.": "<b>Recommendation</b> = minimum number of a single unit type so that <b>all max loot is carried</b> and <b>attack strength ≥ dungeon strength</b> (losses ≤ 10%). Hover a number for details.",
