 "Extension browser (Chrome, Edge, Firefox &amp; Safari) pembantu untuk <b>Lord of Ultima: Revival</b> (<a href=\"https://lordofultima.me/\" target=\"_blank\">lordofultima.me</a>). Semua data dibaca dari game yang sedang kamu buka — tanpa input manual.": "A helper browser extension (Chrome, Edge, Firefox &amp; Safari) for <b>Lord of Ultima: Revival</b> (<a href=\"https://lordofultima.me/\" target=\"_blank\">lordofultima.me</a>). All data is read from the game you have open — no manual input.",
 "<b>Chrome / Edge:</b> ekstrak ZIP, buka <code>chrome://extensions</code> atau <code>edge://extensions</code>, nyalakan <b>Developer mode</b> → <b>Load unpacked</b> → pilih foldernya (update: timpa folder lalu klik ↻).": "<b>Chrome / Edge:</b> extract the ZIP, open <code>chrome://extensions</code> or <code>edge://extensions</code>, turn on <b>Developer mode</b> → <b>Load unpacked</b> → select the folder (to update: overwrite the folder, then click ↻).",
 "<b>Firefox:</b> pasang file <code>.xpi</code> (perlu ditandatangani Mozilla), atau untuk mencoba: <code>about:debugging</code> → This Firefox → <b>Load Temporary Add-on</b>. Izinkan akses ke lordofultima.me lewat popup extension.": "<b>Firefox:</b> install the <code>.xpi</code> file (must be signed by Mozilla), or to try it out: <code>about:debugging</code> → This Firefox → <b>Load Temporary Add-on</b>. Allow access to lordofultima.me from the extension popup.",
 "<b>Safari (macOS):</b> ubah folder safari menjadi app dengan <code>xcrun safari-web-extension-converter</code> di Xcode, jalankan, lalu aktifkan di Safari → Settings → Extensions. Langkah lengkap ada di README.": "<b>Safari (macOS):</b> turn the safari folder into an app with <code>xcrun safari-web-extension-converter</code> in Xcode, run it, then enable it in Safari → Settings → Extensions. Full steps are in the README.",
 "Akses diizinkan. Refresh tab game.": "Access granted. Refresh the game tab.",
 "Extension belum diizinkan membaca lordofultima.me, jadi data game tidak terbaca.": "The extension is not allowed to read lordofultima.me yet, so no game data can be read.",
 "Izinkan akses ke lordofultima.me": "Allow access to lordofultima.me",
 "🌐 Kini tersedia untuk Chrome, Edge, Firefox & Safari: satu kode sumber yang dibangun per browser dengan npm run build (Firefox sebagai .xpi, Safari lewat konverter Xcode). Popup menampilkan tombol Izinkan akses bila browser belum memberi izin ke lordofultima.me, notifikasi otomatis dilewati di browser yang tidak mendukungnya, dan README berisi cara pasang untuk tiap browser.": "🌐 Now available for Chrome, Edge, Firefox & Safari: one source built per browser with npm run build (Firefox as an .xpi, Safari through the Xcode converter). The popup shows an Allow access button when the browser has not granted access to lordofultima.me yet, notifications are skipped automatically in browsers that do not support them, and the README explains how to install it in each browser.",
 "Kebijakan privasi lengkap": "Full privacy policy",
 "Privasi": "Privacy",
 "📄 Kebijakan privasi (Privacy policy) untuk Chrome Web Store dan browser lain: data apa saja yang dibaca, disimpan di mana (hanya lokal di browser), apa yang dikirim (hanya setelan minister ke game, saat kamu klik), alasan tiap izin, dan cara menghapus data. Bisa dibuka dari popup (Privasi) dan Tentang → Keamanan & privasi; tersedia juga sebagai PRIVACY.md / PRIVACY.id.md.": "📄 Privacy policy for the Chrome Web Store and other browsers: what data is read, where it is stored (only locally in your browser), what is sent (only minister settings to the game, when you click), why each permission is needed, and how to delete your data. Open it from the popup (Privacy) and About → Security & privacy; also available as PRIVACY.md / PRIVACY.id.md."
